B.a9m=new A.d2("Adding to it","Open Chat, then You. Type a note or attach a file. You can also share something to NO SUS from another app: it opens Send with You already picked.",!1)
B.a9J=new A.d2("Before Drive is connected","What you add waits on this phone as Not saved yet, and is stored as soon as you connect.",!1)
B.ah0=s([B.a9t,B.a9m,B.a9J],t.eH)
B.aot=s(["saved","you","drive","google drive","notes to self","library","keep"],t.s)
B.aa0=new A.jl("no-sus-chat","NO SUS Chat","A chat with yourself for notes, links and files, kept in your own Google Drive.",B.abc,B.ah0,B.aot)
B.a9j=new A.d2("How","On the other screen, open nosus.foo/go. On your phone, open Chat, tap Open on any screen and scan the QR it shows. Match the number, then choose what that screen can open.",!1)
B.a9N=new A.d2("Your account stays on your phone","The other screen only gets the items you approve, and only while the session is open.",!1)
B.a9x=new A.d2("After the session","Ending the session stops that screen from opening anything else. Files you downloaded or printed there can stay on it, so use a screen you trust.",!0)
B.al8=s([B.a9j,B.a9N,B.a9x],t.eH)
B.anS=s(["go","computer","borrowed","laptop","qr","scan","print","desk"],t.s)
B.aa9=new A.jl("open-on-any-screen","Open on any screen","Open your own chat on a computer without signing in to Google there.",B.py,B.al8,B.anS)
B.ab7=new A.b0(62293,"MaterialIcons",!0)
B.a9v=new A.d2("What and where","Choose a file or write a note. Send it to You, to one of your groups, or to Anyone with a link. Anyone with a link needs no account to open it.",!1)
B.a9o=new A.d2("How it opens","For a link, turn on one of: One open, Watermarked, or Traceable copies. Each one says what it does right under it.",!1)
B.a9c=new A.d2("Opening a link or code","Send \u2192 Open a link or code. Codes work once and expire.",!1)
B.a9S=new A.d2("Sending nearby","Sending between two phones on the same Wi-Fi was removed. Send a link instead.",!1)
B.aiK=s([B.a9v,B.a9o,B.a9c,B.a9S],t.eH)
B.amN=s(["share","send","link","share sheet","nearby","receive","address","drop"],t.s)
B.aa5=new A.jl("send","Send","One flow: what, where, how.",B.ab7,B.aiK,B.amN)
B.a9R=new A.d2("How it works","It is encrypted on your phone first. The key goes in the link, after the # sign, which browsers never send to a server. The first person to open the link gets it, and the stored copy is deleted.",!1)
B.a9r=new A.d2("Limits","Up to 10 files and 50 MB together in one link. A single file can also get a short code to type in. While that code is unused, a copy of the key is kept on our server for up to 20 minutes.",!1)
B.a9E=new A.d2("It really is one open","If a chat app previews the link, that counts as the open. The person then sees that it was already opened, which tells you something got to it first.",!0)
B.aj9=s([B.a9R,B.a9r,B.a9E],t.eH)
B.akf=s(["burn","burn note","burn file","secret","self destruct","one time","password","anonymous","size limit"],t.s)
B.aa4=new A.jl("one-open","One open","A note or file that is gone after the first person opens it. No account needed on either end.",B.w4,B.aj9,B.akf)
B.w2=new A.b0(61170,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a9b=new A.d2("How it works","Watermarked links are made from a file in one of your groups, so Send adds the file to a group first. You set how long the link works and how many times it can be opened.",!1)
B.a9D=new A.d2("What you see","Each link has a log of when it was opened. You can revoke it at any time.",!1)
B.a99=new A.d2("In a browser","A browser cannot block screenshots. The name on every page is what points back to the reader.",!0)
B.ais=s([B.a9b,B.a9D,B.a99],t.eH)
B.agz=s(["securesend","share link","access controls","expiry","view limit","revoke","analytics"],t.s)
B.aa7=new A.jl("watermarked","Watermarked","A link to one file that shows the reader\u2019s name on every page. You can revoke it.",B.w2,B.ais,B.agz)
B.abe=new A.b0(63330,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a9u=new A.d2("How it works","NO SUS makes one copy per reader, each with tiny wording changes that read the same. The note needs enough lines for the changes to fit; if it is too short, add a few more.",!1)
B.a9e=new A.d2("If it leaks","Paste the leaked text into the leak check on your note. It tells you which copy it came from.",!1)
B.a9w=new A.d2("Notes only for now",u.fD,!1)
B.a9H=new A.d2("What it can\u2019t catch","Someone who rewrites the text in their own words can remove the changes.",!0)
B.am7=s([B.a9u,B.a9e,B.a9w,B.a9H],t.eH)
B.aop=s(["canary","leak","trace","fingerprint","copies","who leaked"],t.s)
B.aa3=new A.jl("traceable-copies","Traceable copies","Each person gets a slightly different copy of a note. If it leaks, you\u2019ll know whose.",B.abe,B.am7,B.aop)
B.aaT=new A.b0(61657,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a9I=new A.d2("Joining","Chat \u2192 Join with a link, then paste the invite link or code. You see the group name and how many members it has before you join. There is no list of groups to browse.",!1)
B.a9l=new A.d2("Starting one","Chat \u2192 New group. You become its admin. You can turn on an 8-character invite code, or invite people only with links you make.",!1)
B.a9h=new A.d2("Leaving","Open the group \u2192 Group options (top right) \u2192 Leave group. Anything you added stays with the group. The only admin has to make someone else admin first, and the only member deletes the group by leaving.",!1)
B.afY=s([B.a9I,B.a9l,B.a9h],t.eH)
B.apX=s(["community","join","invite","create group","leave","new group"],t.s)
B.aa_=new A.jl("groups","Groups","A group chat for files, with its own members and activity. You join by invite.",B.aaT,B.afY,B.apX)
B.a9P=new A.d2("Members can","Read every file in the group, add their own, rename and delete what they added, and see the group\u2019s activity.",!1)
B.a9C=new A.d2("Admins can also","Promote and demote members, remove and ban people, delete any file, manage invite links, and delete the group.",!1)
B.a9T=new A.d2("How it is enforced","By the database, not the app. The check runs on the server on every change, so an edited app gets a refusal, not a shortcut.",!1)
B.apE=s([B.a9P,B.a9C,B.a9T],t.eH)
B.akG=s(["admin","member","permission","promote","demote","remove","ban","moderation"],t.s)
B.aaa=new A.jl("roles","Roles and permissions","Groups have admins and members. Admins manage people and files; members read and add.",B.E3,B.apE,B.akG)
B.a9a=new A.d2("Adding","Open a group \u2192 Add a group file, or Send a file to the group. Everyone in the group can read it.",!1)
B.a9Q=new A.d2("Reading","Tap a file to open it in the protected viewer. Chat \u2192 All files lists every file from your groups.",!1)
B.a9U=new A.d2("Touch to reveal","The page stays blurred until you hold your finger on it, which stops the person behind you. Turn it off in Settings \u2192 Privacy & Security.",!1)
B.a9L=new A.d2("What this does not do","Group files are not end-to-end encrypted. They are stored on our server and access is checked by database rules. For that, send a One open link instead: it is encrypted on your phone.",!0)
B.aoS=s([B.a9a,B.a9Q,B.a9U,B.a9L],t.eH)
B.aiS=s(["file","upload","pdf","vault","all files","viewer","study desk"],t.s)
B.a9Z=new A.jl("secure-documents","Files in groups","Files in a group open in the protected viewer, marked with the reader\u2019s name.",B.ce,B.aoS,B.aiS)
B.a9A=new A.d2("Watermarks","Your email and the time are drawn over every page you open. A photo of the screen carries them too, so a leaked page points back to who opened it.",!1)
B.a96=new A.d2("Screenshot blocking is Android-only","On Android the app blocks screenshots and screen recording, and records the attempt. On the web and on iOS nothing can stop a screenshot. There, the watermark and the activity log protect you.",!0)
B.a9d=new A.d2("A camera always wins","No app can stop someone photographing their screen with another phone. These controls tell you who, after the fact.",!0)
B.ajQ=s([B.a9A,B.a96,B.a9d],t.eH)
B.aoK=s(["watermark","screenshot","screen record","capture","leak"],t.s)
B.aa2=new A.jl("watermarking","Watermarks and screenshots","Open files carry your name on screen, and on Android screenshots are blocked.",B.w2,B.ajQ,B.aoK)
B.aaU=new A.b0(61697,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a9s=new A.d2("What is recorded","Joins and leaves, files added, renamed, deleted and opened, screenshot attempts, and admin actions. It records who and when, never what a file says.",!1)
B.a9n=new A.d2("Visible to everyone in the group","Members see what admins do as easily as admins see members. Nobody gets a private log.",!1)
B.a97=new A.d2("Tamper evidence","Entries are chained, so removing or editing one breaks the chain. Nothing can be quietly taken back, including by admins.",!1)
B.aqe=s([B.a9s,B.a9n,B.a97],t.eH)
